# NOTICE — bundled data provenance

## data/WW15MGH.DAC — EGM96 15-minute geoid undulation grid

This repository (and the published crate) includes `data/WW15MGH.DAC`, the
WW15MGH 15-arc-minute worldwide geoid-height grid of the Earth Gravitational
Model 1996 (EGM96).

- Producers: the U.S. National Imagery and Mapping Agency (NIMA, today the
  National Geospatial-Intelligence Agency, NGA) and the NASA Goddard Space
  Flight Center, with The Ohio State University.
- Source: the NGA / NASA EGM96 model distribution
  (https://earth-info.nga.mil/ and
  https://cddis.nasa.gov/926/egm96/egm96.html).
- Status: a work of the United States Government, distributed publicly and,
  as a U.S. Government work, not subject to copyright protection in the
  United States (17 U.S.C. § 105).

The grid file is data, not code: it is *not* covered by this crate's MIT or
Apache-2.0 license, and nothing in this repository claims copyright over it.
It is redistributed here unmodified (verified by the loader's dimensional
checks) for build-time embedding (`embedded-egm96` feature) and for tests.

Use of the data does not imply endorsement by NGA, NIMA, or NASA.

